  "id": "iat",
  "term": "IAT",
  "definition": "IAT refers to the Implicit Association Test, a research method used to capture automatic evaluative associations that people may not be able to report directly. In this context, it is used to assess implicit attitudes, such as automatic responses related to physical activity.",
